silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_01_thesis_concrete_anchor_7_P_general#mittensvetrecordpresheafanchornode7 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecordPresheafAnchorNode7 is the Mittens vet-record presheaf P sending each schema object to its observed-record set and each schema arrow to a contravariant restriction map. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'P_general', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
